    ["<Assistant_Title1>【镜中的廷根】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务类型：</><Assistant_Property2>现实主线</>\n<Assistant_Title2>任务描述：</>越来越多的市民失踪了，必须尽快查出灾祸源头……先去梦中的诡异湖边看看。\n<Assistant_Title2>领取方式：</>第一赛季第四天解锁。完成主线剧情第三章《暗涌的危机》，且扮演等级达到<Assistant_Red>52级</>后自动接取。\n<Assistant_Title2>任务奖励</>：认知经验、绑定苏勒、绑定金镑、星币、魔药主材料、武器箱、中级深红精粹、中级狂暴药剂"] = "<Assistant_Title1>【Tingen in the Mirror】</>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Type: </><Assistant_Property2>Reality Main Story </>\n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Description: </>More and more citizens are going missing; the source of the disaster must be found as soon as possible... First, go and check the strange lakeside in your dream. \n<Assistant_Title2>How to Accept: </>Unlocked on the fourth day of the first season. Automatically accepted after completing Chapter 3 of the main story, \"Crisis of Dark Currents,\" and reaching <Assistant_Red>Acting Level 52</>. \n<Assistant_Title2>Quest Rewards</>: Cognition EXP, Bound Soule, Bound Gold Pound, Star Coin, Potion Main Materials, Weapon Box, Intermediate Crimson Essence, Intermediate Berserk Potion",
